---
import SystemField from "../visual/SystemField.astro";
---

<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="home-hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">FORWARD DEPLOYED ENGINEERING</p>
    <h1>We embed with your team, find the work that is eating it, and deliver a working result.</h1>
    <p class="home-hero-lede">
      Obedience Corp is a forward deployed engineering company. You don’t
      adopt a new tool or change how you work. Your team reviews every
      change, and the result runs in your environment. If you don’t know
      where to start, finding the highest-leverage problem is where we
      begin.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a
        class="action action-primary"
        href="#contact"
      >Discuss an engagement</a>
      <a class="action action-secondary" href="#selected-work"
        >See the work ↓</a
      >
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="hero-instrument" aria-label="Obedience Corp operating model">
    <SystemField label="OBEDIENCE / OPERATING FIELD" status="LAB MODEL" compact />
    <p class="hero-figure-caption">
      The model is one component. Dependable work comes from the operating
      system around it.
    </p>
  </aside>
</section>

<nav class="hero-ledger" aria-label="Obedience Corp lab index">
  <a href="https://fest.build">
    <span>01 / PUBLIC WORK</span>
    <strong>Festival</strong>
    <small>The open-source system behind the engagements</small>
    <em>SHIPPED ↗</em>
  </a>
  <a href="/blog">
    <span>02 / RESEARCH</span>
    <strong>Field notes</strong>
    <small>Reports from building and operating AI systems</small>
    <em>READ →</em>
  </a>
  <a href="#contact">
    <span>03 / APPLIED WORK</span>
    <strong>Engagements</strong>
    <small>Embedded engineering with a paid first phase and a defined end</small>
    <em>OPEN →</em>
  </a>
</nav>
